# Client-side routing (React Router) — send every path to index.html so
# /services, /careers, /contact etc. work on a direct load and on refresh.
#
# netlify.toml does the same thing, but only for deploys connected to a git
# repository. This file gets copied into dist/ by the build, so it also covers
# manual drag-and-drop deploys where netlify.toml is never uploaded.
/*  /index.html  200
